1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,940
I couldn't stop the cancer or the things that chemo took

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:05,460
But I could choose the face I wore and every way I'd look

3
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:09,460
'Cause I'd hurt worse watching someone that I love go through the same

4
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:13,220
So I kept the fear behind my eyes, and I held on to the pain

5
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:16,500
Every time they looked at me, I gave them calm instead of fear

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:20,420
That was the only wheel I had, so that's the one I steered
